prefabriceerde houten module, volledig in de werkplaats gebouwd en in één stuk geleverd. C24-houtconstructie (Scandinavisch vuren, regel 45 x 95 mm), 10 cm harde wolisolatie in vloer, wanden en dak, aan de buitenzijde Steico Black bitumenplaat 22 mm en een gevel van verticale houten lamellen met messing en groef, beschermd met Remmers-lazuur.', 'Trapeziumplaat in antraciet', 'De sauna wordt geconfigureerd volgens de wensen van de klant; de mogelijkheden voor uitvoering en aanpassing van gekozen onderdelen worden individueel afgesproken.', NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO "product_translation" ("id", "product_id", "locale", "name", "description", "created_at", "updated_at", "room_layout", "faq", "ai_generated_name", "ai_generated_description", "ai_translated_from_name", "ai_translated_from_description", "client_requirements", "foundation_options", "technical_specs", "construction_system", "roof_type", "customization_scope", "service_scope_description") VALUES ('dbacfaf8-8789-4f23-98c0-e2b2ae3dcd00', '0186d762-b49b-594b-a9f2-55de0f7e1fe0', 'de', NULL, 'Geräumige Gartensauna für 6-7 Personen mit Lamellenfassade, großer Verglasung mit verschiebbarer Lamellenblende für Privatsphäre, separatem Vorraum und traditionellem holzbefeuertem Stoveman-Ofen mit Feuerung von außen.', '2026-10-30T14:16:19.396Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-30T19:40:59.660Z'::timestamptz, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Untergrundvorbereitung durch den Kunden; das Abladen (Kran, HDS oder Gabelstapler mit ausreichender Tragkraft) organisiert der Bauherr', '{"specs":{"glazingType":{"value":"Großes gehärtetes Zweifachverglasungsfenster mit äußerer verschiebbarer Lamellenblende; Tür zum Saunaraum aus gehärtetem Glas"},"benchMaterial":{"value":"Erle (zweistufige Bänke und Rückenlehne); Fichtenbank im Vorraum"},"insulationType":{"value":"10 cm harte Wolle in Boden, Wänden und Dach; innen Sauna-Aluminiumfolie"},"claddingMaterial":{"value":"Lamellenbretter 2 cm mit Nut und Feder, Remmers-Lasur; darunter Steico-Black-Bitumenplatte 22 mm"},"interiorWoodType":{"value":"Astfreie Lindenverkleidung (Saunaraum), Fichtenverkleidung (Vorraum)"},"electricalRequirement":{"value":"Holzbefeuerter Stoveman-Ofen (kein Elektroofen); Strom für die RGB-Beleuchtung mit Fernbedienung und die Außenbeleuchtung mit Dämmerungssensor"},"changingAreaDescription":{"value":"Separater Vorraum mit Fichtenverkleidung, Bank, 6 Kleiderhaken und Keramikfliesen auf dem Boden"}}}'::jsonb, 'Vorgefertigtes Holzmodul, vollständig in der Halle gefertigt und im Ganzen geliefert. Konstruktion aus C24-Holz (skandinavische Fichte, Kantholz 45 x 95 mm), 10 cm harte Wolldämmung in Boden, Wänden und Dach, außen Steico-Black-Bitumenplatte 22 mm und Fassade aus senkrechten Holzlamellen mit Nut und Feder, mit Remmers-Lasur geschützt.', 'Trapezblech in Anthrazit', 'Die Sauna wird nach den Wünschen des Kunden konfiguriert; die Möglichkeiten zur Ausführung und Anpassung ausgewählter Elemente werden individuell vereinbart.', NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO "product_translation" ("id", "product_id", "locale", "name", "description", "created_at", "updated_at", "room_layout", "faq", "ai_generated_name", "ai_generated_description", "ai_translated_from_name", "ai_translated_from_description", "client_requirements", "foundation_options", "technical_specs", "construction_system", "roof_type", "customization_scope", "service_scope_description") VALUES ('327765eb-9bd0-49db-949f-e262d31131c8', '0186d762-b49b-594b-a9f2-55de0f7e1fe0', 'en', NULL, 'A spacious garden sauna for 6-7 people with a slat facade, large glazing with a sliding slat cover for privacy, a separate vestibule and a traditional Stoveman wood-fired heater with the firebox on the outside.', '2026-10-30T14:16:19.396Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-30T19:40:59.660Z'::timestamptz, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Ground preparation by the customer; unloading (crane, HIAB truck or forklift of adequate capacity) is arranged by the investor', '{"specs":{"glazingType":{"value":"Large tempered double-glazed window with an exterior sliding slat cover; tempered glass door to the sauna room"},"benchMaterial":{"value":"Alder (two-level benches and backrest); spruce bench in the vestibule"},"insulationType":{"value":"10 cm hard wool in the floor, walls and roof; sauna aluminium foil on the inside"},"claddingMaterial":{"value":"2 cm tongue-and-groove slat boards, Remmers lazure; Steico Black 22 mm bitumen board underneath"},"interiorWoodType":{"value":"Knot-free linden paneling (sauna room), spruce paneling (vestibule)"},"electricalRequirement":{"value":"Stoveman wood-fired heater (no electric heater); power for the RGB lighting with a remote and the exterior lighting with a dusk sensor"},"changingAreaDescription":{"value":"Separate vestibule with spruce paneling, a bench, 6 hangers and ceramic floor tiles"}}}'::jsonb, 'Prefabricated timber module built entirely in the workshop and delivered in one piece. C24 timber structure (Scandinavian spruce, 45 x 95 mm), 10 cm hard wool insulation in the floor, walls and roof, Steico Black 22 mm bitumen board outside and a facade of vertical tongue-and-groove wooden slats protected with Remmers lazure.', 'Trapezoidal sheet metal in anthracite', 'The sauna is configured to the customer''s expectations; the available options for making and adapting selected elements are agreed individually.', NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO "product_translation" ("id", "product_id", "locale", "name", "description", "created_at", "updated_at", "room_layout", "faq", "ai_generated_name", "ai_generated_description", "ai_translated_from_name", "ai_translated_from_description", "client_requirements", "foundation_options", "technical_specs", "construction_system", "roof_type", "customization_scope", "service_scope_description") VALUES ('e879e63e-0ace-44b5-8e88-0798b87195ae', 'd5e91d88-542d-5e29-a19e-5b47c1439038', 'de', NULL, 'Erweiterte Gartensauna für 5-6 Personen: dunkle Fassade aus senkrechten Lamellen, große Frontverglasung, dekorative Beleuchtung und separater Vorraum mit Dusche. Harvia-Ofen PC90, Audiosystem mit JBL-Lautsprechern.', '2026-10-30T14:16:25.002Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-30T19:41:01.295Z'::timestamptz, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Untergrundvorbereitung durch den Kunden; das Abladen (Kran, HDS oder Gabelstapler mit ausreichender Tragkraft) organisiert der Bauherr', '{"specs":{"glazingType":{"value":"Fenster aus gehärtetem Glas als Zweifachverglasung; Saunatür aus gehärtetem Glas"},"benchMaterial":{"value":"Erle (Bänke und Rückenlehnen)"},"insulationType":{"value":"10 cm harte Wolle in Boden, Wänden und Dach; innen Sauna-Aluminiumfolie"},"claddingMaterial":{"value":"Senkrechte Holzlamellen mit Nut und Feder, Remmers-Lasur; darunter Steico-Black-Bitumenplatte 22 mm"},"interiorWoodType":{"value":"Astfreie Wandverkleidung aus Linde"},"electricalRequirement":{"value":"Elektrischer Harvia-Ofen PC90 (anderer Ofen wählbar); RGB-Beleuchtung mit Fernbedienung; JBL-Audio mit Dexon-Steuerung; Duschboiler; mechanische Lüftung mit Feuchtesensor"},"changingAreaDescription":{"value":"Separater Vorraum mit Regenbrause-Dusche, 6 Kleiderhaken und Keramikfliesen"}}}'::jsonb, 'Vorgefertigtes Holzmodul, vollständig in der Halle gefertigt und im Ganzen geliefert. Konstruktion aus C24-Holz (skandinavische Fichte, Kantholz 45 x 95 mm), 10 cm harte Wolldämmung in Boden, Wänden und Dach, außen Steico-Black-Bitumenplatte 22 mm und Fassade aus senkrechten Holzlamellen mit Nut und Feder, mit Remmers-Lasur geschützt.', 'Trapezblech in Anthrazit', 'Ein anderer Ofen und ein anderer Boiler für den Duschbereich sind wählbar; Konfigurationsdetails und Ausstattungsänderungen werden bei der Bestellung individuell vereinbart.', NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO "product_translation" ("id", "product_id", "locale", "name", "description", "created_at", "updated_at", "room_layout", "faq", "ai_generated_name", "ai_generated_description", "ai_translated_from_name", "ai_translated_from_description", "client_requirements", "foundation_options", "technical_specs", "construction_system", "roof_type", "customization_scope", "service_scope_description") VALUES ('a7858d23-85c7-4628-b105-8fdbb332fc10', 'd5e91d88-542d-5e29-a19e-5b47c1439038', 'en', NULL, 'An extended garden sauna for 5-6 people: a dark facade of vertical slats, large front glazing, decorative lighting and a separate vestibule with a shower. Harvia PC90 heater, audio system with JBL speakers.', '2026-10-30T14:16:25.002Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-30T19:41:01.295Z'::timestamptz, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Ground preparation by the customer; unloading (crane, HIAB truck or forklift of adequate capacity) is arranged by the investor', '{"specs":{"glazingType":{"value":"Tempered double-glazed window; tempered glass sauna door"},"benchMaterial":{"value":"Alder (benches and backrests)"},"insulationType":{"value":"10 cm hard wool in the floor, walls and roof; sauna aluminium foil on the inside"},"claddingMaterial":{"value":"Vertical tongue-and-groove wooden slats, Remmers lazure; Steico Black 22 mm bitumen board underneath"},"interiorWoodType":{"value":"Knot-free linden paneling"},"electricalRequirement":{"value":"Harvia PC90 electric heater (another heater can be chosen); RGB lighting with a remote; JBL audio with Dexon control; shower boiler; mechanical ventilation with a humidity sensor"},"changingAreaDescription":{"value":"Separate vestibule with a rain-head shower, 6 hangers and ceramic tiles"}}}'::jsonb, 'Prefabricated timber module built entirely in the workshop and delivered in one piece. C24 timber structure (Scandinavian spruce, 45 x 95 mm), 10 cm hard wool insulation in the floor, walls and roof, Steico Black 22 mm bitumen board outside and a facade of vertical tongue-and-groove wooden slats protected with Remmers lazure.', 'Trapezoidal sheet metal in anthracite', 'A different heater and a different boiler for the shower area can be chosen; configuration details and equipment changes are agreed individually when ordering.', NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO "product_translation" ("id", "product_id", "locale", "name", "description", "created_at", "updated_at", "room_layout", "faq", "ai_generated_name", "ai_generated_description", "ai_translated_from_name", "ai_translated_from_description", "client_requirements", "foundation_options", "technical_specs", "construction_system", "roof_type", "customization_scope", "service_scope_description") VALUES ('ae0102ce-7812-4303-beee-194e24f38ac9', 'd5e91d88-542d-5e29-a19e-5b47c1439038', 'nl', NULL, 'Uitgebreide tuinsauna voor 5-6 personen: een donkere gevel van verticale lamellen, grote beglazing aan de voorzijde, decoratieve verlichting en een aparte voorruimte met douche. Harvia PC90 kachel, audiosysteem met JBL-luidsprekers.', '2026-10-30T14:16:25.002Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-30T19:41:01.295Z'::timestamptz, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Voorbereiding van de ondergrond door de klant; het lossen (kraan, laadkraan of vorkheftruck met voldoende hefvermogen) wordt door de opdrachtgever geregeld', '{"specs":{"glazingType":{"value":"Raam van gehard glas met dubbele beglazing; saunadeur van gehard glas"},"benchMaterial":{"value":"Els (banken en rugleuningen)"},"insulationType":{"value":"10 cm harde wol in vloer, wanden en dak; aan de binnenzijde sauna-aluminiumfolie"},"claddingMaterial":{"value":"Verticale houten lamellen met messing en groef, Remmers-lazuur; eronder Steico Black bitumenplaat 22 mm"},"interiorWoodType":{"value":"Kwastvrije lindehouten wandbekleding"},"electricalRequirement":{"value":"Elektrische Harvia PC90 kachel (andere kachel te kiezen); RGB-verlichting met afstandsbediening; JBL-audio met Dexon-besturing; douche-boiler; mechanische ventilatie met vochtsensor"},"changingAreaDescription":{"value":"Aparte voorruimte met regendouche, 6 kapstokhaken en keramische tegels"}}}'::jsonb, 'Geprefabriceerde houten module, volledig in de werkplaats gebouwd en in één stuk geleverd. C24-houtconstructie (Scandinavisch vuren, regel 45 x 95 mm), 10 cm harde wolisolatie in vloer, wanden en dak, aan de buitenzijde Steico Black bitumenplaat 22 mm en een gevel van verticale houten lamellen met messing en groef, beschermd met Remmers-lazuur.', 'Trapeziumplaat in antraciet', 'Een andere kachel en een andere boiler voor de douchezone zijn te kiezen; configuratiedetails en uitrustingswijzigingen worden bij de bestelling individueel afgesproken.', NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
